Internally, the implementation avoids materializing the array and immediately returns one document per match, the two stages $lookup and $unwind being optimized into a single [lookup-unwind](https://github.com/mongodb/mongo/blob/r8.2.2/src/mongo/db/query/stage_builder/sbe/gen_lookup.cpp#L664) stage that acts like a SQL join.

Note that because there are no items in the employees array, there are no documents in the output for department 40. This is exactly like an INNER JOIN in SQL.

